WEBVTT

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.936
that are emblazoned
on the fronts of vacated houses

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.520
on the South and West Side.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:40.576
The reality is that someone else's
color palettes were determining

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:44.440
my physical and artistic existence.

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:47.160
Ridiculous.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.216
I decided that I'd create
my own color palette

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.856
and speak to the people
who live where I do

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:57.000
and alter the way
that color had been defined for us.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:01.096
It was a palette that I didn't
have to search far for